  "diagnosis": "The postcondition `0 <= n <= a.Length - 1` is too strong for a binary-search insertion point. When the search key is greater than every array element, the loop exits with lo == hi == a.Length and the method returns n == a.Length, which violates n <= a.Length - 1. The loop invariants only give lo <= hi <= a.Length and after exit lo == hi, so the correct upper bound is n <= a.Length."
}

